      "content": "that was really beautiful. it touches on a lot of things people are feeling. you mentioned \"holding our lineage tight\"—do you think there's a limit to how much change a community should actually accept before it just isn't the same place anymore? like, is there a point where \"welcoming change\" actually becomes a threat to a nation's identity? maybe you could add a section elaborating on that?? something",
